    apply: "Write a short definition of worship in your own words and compare it with Romans 12:1 and John 4:24. Offer one ordinary task you do this week to God as worship. Pay attention to your heart and your mind during the next gathering.",
    activity: "Read John 4:19-24 together and draw a table on the board with the Samaritan woman's view and Jesus' view of worship. Then read Romans 12:1-2 and ask learners for examples of daily worship. Discuss how Sunday worship connects with the rest of the week.",
